  "dependency": "DUB-17 Theorem 2.6 / DUB-18 Corollary 8.2 -> residual association -> primitive determinant -> required component pairing -> original Tate nondegeneracy -> auxiliary point division -> actual cover Abel converse -> bilinear and third-kind reciprocity -> exact global weighted residue sum",
